   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "The Board confirms that the final results are expected to be in line with the trading update provided on 7 September 2021 which said \"that the Board now expects the Group's full year results to be materially ahead of current market expectations with adjusted operating profit expected to be no less than £50m.\"",
   "file": "20211206_RNWH_Final-Results-Revised-Date.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2021-12-09",
   "doc": "FY R",
   "fy": "FY22",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "I am pleased to report that we have carried forward this positive trading momentum into the new financial year and have a strong forward order book which underpins our confidence in achieving further progress in 2022.",
   "file": "20211209_RNWH_Final-Results.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2022-01-26",
   "doc": "AGM",
   "fy": "FY22",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "Trading for the first quarter of the year has continued in line with the Board's expectations.",
   "file": "20220126_RNWH_AGM-Statement.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2022-04-01",
   "doc": "H1 TU",
   "fy": "FY22",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "The Board is pleased to confirm that trading for the first half of the year is in-line with management's expectations.",
   "file": "20220401_RNWH_H1-Trading-Update.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2022-05-17",
   "doc": "H1 R",
   "fy": "FY22",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "Trading has started well in the second half of the year and we remain confident of achieving our full year expectations. We continue to successfully manage the industry-wide challenges around staff retention, material shortages and inflation, without any material impact on trading.",
   "file": "20220517_RNWH_Half-year-Report.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2022-10-03",
   "doc": "YE-TU",
   "fy": "FY22",
   "g": "RAISE",
   "s": 1,
   "q": "As a result, the Board expects the Group to report results for the year marginally ahead of market consensus1.",
   "file": "20221003_RNWH_Year-End-Trading-Update.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2022-11-29",
   "doc": "FY R",
   "fy": "FY23",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "In line with previous years, we have entered the new financial year with our order book in a strong position and trading in the new year has begun positively.",
